From: OpenAI Codex <codex@openai.com>
Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: propagate PPE SRAM publication errors

The new baseline already includes CPU MMIO SRAM publication and the
100 us ACK poll. Remove the inner err variable that hides failed SRAM
commits from setup; retain the upstream publication implementation.

Signed-off-by: OpenAI Codex <codex@openai.com>
---

--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_ppe.c
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_ppe.c
@@ -1610,8 +1610,6 @@
 	int i, err = 0;
 
 	for (i = 0; i < sram_num_entries; i++) {
-		int err;
-
 		memset(&hwe[i], 0, sizeof(*hwe));
 		err = airoha_ppe_foe_commit_sram_entry(ppe, i);
 		if (err)
